ent or even dilution  of the European Union's a great deal of  favor and that's Moscow as evidenced by  some of the behavior of mr. Putin in  recent weeks so we have to remember that  what we do domestically here in the  United Kingdom of what we do within the  European Union can have implications  well beyond the boundaries of both are  always fascinating to talk to you thanks  very much making at that point there  some in campbell there live in the  scottish capital edinburgh
 

